    "sections": {
        "description": "Psychology and Wellness is a clean and structured website theme designed for presenting mental wellness, counseling, therapy, mindfulness, and self-care related content. The layout includes customizable homepage sections, service blocks, testimonial areas, blog integration, and contact forms for organized content display. It supports responsive layouts for desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme includes typography controls, color customization options, banner sections, call-to-action areas, and social media integration. It is compatible with standard plugins for forms, SEO, and page building. The code structure is optimized for smooth navigation and faster loading performance. Additional features include gallery support, team sections, appointment-related layouts, and customizable widgets. The design focuses on readability with balanced spacing, clean visuals, and flexible content arrangements suitable for informational and professional websites."
    },
